    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but staying in this empty space is so exhausting. it feels pointless. like there's no reason to keep doing the daily stuff, the eating, the sleeping, the working... when the person who made all that matter is just gone. it's like being a ghost that's forced to stay in a world that doesn't even have a place for me anymore.",
